#: ../../content/applications/sales/sales/ebay_connector/setup.rst:6
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Преглед"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/sales/ebay_connector/setup.rst:8
msgid ""
"Odoo's eBay connector allows eBay listings to connect with Odoo products. "
"Once connected, :doc:`updates to the listings <linking_listings>` can be made "
"in Odoo or in eBay. When an item sells on eBay, draft *sales orders* are "
"created in Odoo for the user to review and confirm. Once the sales order is "
"confirmed, Odoo *Inventory* and *Sales* apps function standard to pull "
"products out of inventory, and allow the user to create invoices."
